tern\\\":\\\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\\\"},\\n    \\\"created_at\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"date-time\\\"},\\n    \\\"expires_at\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"date-time\\\"}\\n  },\\n  \\\"allOf\\\":[{\\\"if\\\":{\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"autonomy_tier\\\":{\\\"const\\\":\\\"T3\\\"}}},\\\"then\\\":{\\\"required\\\":[\\\"independent_checker_required\\\",\\\"independent_checker_policy_ref\\\"],\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"independent_checker_required\\\":{\\\"const\\\":true}}}}]\\n}\\n```\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"$id\\\": \\\"swof://pi-pkg-06/doc-03/HumanGateDecision/1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\\\",\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n  \\\"additionalProperties\\\": false,\\n  \\\"required\\\": [\\\"if06b_version\\\",\\\"payload_schema_version\\\",\\\"min_reader_version\\\",\\\"writer_version\\\",\\\"compatibility_class\\\",\\\"decision_id\\\",\\\"request_id\\\",\\\"decision\\\",\\\"authority_class\\\",\\\"reason_codes\\\",\\\"decision_basis_hash\\\",\\\"decided_at\\\",\\\"evidence_ref\\\",\\\"integrity_ref\\\"],\\n  \\\"properties\\\": {\\n    \\\"decision\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"APPROVE\\\",\\\"DENY\\\",\\\"VETO\\\",\\\"REVOKE\\\",\\\"SAFE_STOP\\\"]},\\n    \\\"authority_class\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"HA1\\\",\\\"HA2\\\",\\\"HA3\\\",\\\"HA4\\\",\\\"HA5\\\"]},\\n    \\\"authn_assurance_class\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"AAC1\\\",\\\"AAC2\\\",\\\"AAC3\\\"]},\\n    \\\"token_issuance_status\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"NOT_REQUIRED\\\",\\\"PENDING\\\",\\\"ISSUED\\\",\\\"FAILED\\\",\\\"INVALIDATED\\\"]},\\n    \\\"decision_basis_hash\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\\\"},\\n    \\\"reason_codes\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\",\\\"minItems\\\":1,\\\"uniqueItems\\\":true,\\\"items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}}\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"$id\\\": \\\"swof://pi-pkg-06/doc-03/ApprovalToken/1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\\\",\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n  \\\"additionalProperties\\\": false,\\n  \\\"required\\\": [\\\"if06b_version\\\",\\\"payload_schema_version\\\",\\\"min_reader_version\\\",\\\"writer_version\\\",\\\"compatibility_class\\\",\\\"token_id\\\",\\\"request_id\\\",\\\"decision_id\\\",\\\"subject\\\",\\\"subject_hash\\\",\\\"semantic_version\\\",\\\"actor\\\",\\\"operation\\\",\\\"target_system\\\",\\\"resource\\\",\\\"environment\\\",\\\"purpose_ref\\\",\\\"scope\\\",\\\"data_class\\\",\\\"effect_digest\\\",\\\"consumer_audience_hash\\\",\\\"approver\\\",\\\"authority_class\\\",\\\"approver_authn_context_ref\\\",\\\"authn_assurance_class\\\",\\\"reauthenticated_at\\\",\\\"authn_session_generation\\\",\\\"credential_generation\\\",\\\"approval_basis_hash\\\",\\\"independent_checker_required\\\",\\\"issued_at\\\",\\\"expires_at\\\",\\\"nonce\\\",\\\"rollback_ref\\\",\\\"token_state\\\",\\\"consumer\\\",\\\"evidence_link\\\",\\\"integrity_profile_id\\\",\\\"issuer_id\\\",\\\"key_id\\\",\\\"key_generation\\\",\\\"signature\\\"],\\n  \\\"properties\\\": {\\n    \\\"token_state\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"ACTIVE\\\",\\\"CONSUMED\\\",\\\"REVOKED\\\",\\\"EXPIRED\\\"]},\\n    \\\"integrity_profile_id\\\":{\\\"const\\\":\\\"SWOF-HG-INTEGRITY-001\\\"},\\n    \\\"subject_hash\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\\\"},\\n    \\\"effect_digest\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\\\"},\\n    \\\"consumer_audience_hash\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\\\"},\\n    \\\"approval_basis_hash\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\\\"},\\n    \\\"scope\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\",\\\"minItems\\\":1,\\\"uniqueItems\\\":true,\\\"items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\n    \\\"signature\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{86}$\\\"}\\n  },\\n  \\\"allOf\\\":[{\\\"if\\\":{\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"independent_checker_required\\\":{\\\"const\\\":true}}},\\\"then\\\":{\\\"required\\\":[\\\"independent_checker_evidence_ref\\\"]}}]\\n}\\n```\\n\\nRuntime implementations MAY generate stricter language-native types, but they may not accept a broader value set than this registry without a versioned schema change.\\n# 16｜Token Admission Invariants / Time / Integrity / Exact Binding\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\r\n.\\evidence\\writer_logs\\CODEX_WO-SWOF-W2-R007.jsonl:109:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_54\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\user\\\\\\\\AppData\\\\\\\\Local\\\\\\\\Microsoft\\\\\\\\WindowsApps\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\" -Command '$f='\\\"'C:\\\\\\\\Projects\\\\\\\\Agent_Workspace\\\\\\\\知識庫\\\\\\\\實作相關DOC\\\\\\\\Fabric vNext\\\\\\\\Semantic World OS Fabric\\\\\\\\SWOF-F_SWOF-GENIE_All-IW_Pre-Dev_Multi-Packages\\\\\\\\PI-PKG\\\\\\\\DOC\\\\\\\\PI-PKG-06_DOC\\\\\\\\SWOF-F_SWOF-GENIE_All-IW_PI-PKG-06_DOC-03_2026-09-10_r2_FULL_REPAIR.md'; \\\"'$lines = Get-Content -LiteralPath $f; $lines[740..800] -join \\\"`n\\\"'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"| Request | Issuance | Token | Meaning |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| REQUIRED | NOT_REQUIRED/PENDING | none | no Human approval yet |\\n| APPROVED | PENDING | none | Human approved; **not executable** |\\n| APPROVED | FAILED | none | Human approved; mint failed; **not executable** |\\n| APPROVED | ISSUED | ACTIVE | potentially executable, still subject to current-at-commit/T3 checker |\\n| APPROVED | ISSUED | CONSUMED | token cannot replay |\\n| APPROVED | INVALIDATED | none/revoked | basis changed; reapproval required |\\n| DENIED/CANCELLED/EXPIRED | any | none or revoked | no effect |\\n\\nTimeout/cancellation/supersession are recorded as immutable lineage events. No state machine rewrites history to simulate a cleaner outcome.\\n# 14｜HumanGatePolicy SPEC / Informed Decision Surface\\n\\n## 14.4 HUMAN_CONTROL_FRICTION_PROFILE\\n\\nHuman control MUST optimize **decision quality**, not click count.\\n\\n| Tier | Presentation/friction | Repeat/batch rule | Anti-fatigue rule |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| T0 | no interrupting approval UI; passive receipt if useful | batching allowed within same local/read boundary | do not train user to click “Approve” for harmless reads |\\n| T1 | show grant boundary once; noninterrupting per-operation receipts | only operations already inside signed grant | grant scope/expiry always visible and revocable |\\n| T2 | deliberate ApprovalView for exact effect; progressive disclosure allowed | no scope widening; consume-once token means each new effect needs a new token/decision | prefill context may reduce typing but MUST NOT preselect approval |\\n| T3 | high-salience view; consequences/irreversibility/checker status above fold | batch approval forbidden | short TTL; explicit affirm action; deny/cancel equally accessible |\\n\\n**Progressive disclosure law:** critical fields—operation, target, scope, data/rights impact, downside, irreversibility, rollback, permission class, T2/T3 status, required checker/coapprovers, expiry—cannot be hidden behind optional expansion. Localization may change wording, never semantics. Accessibility support MUST preserve the same fields in machine-readable accessibility tree.\\n\\n## 14.5 ApprovalView provenance\\n\\nThe runtime MUST hash the exact canonical `ApprovalDecisionBasisV1` used to render the view and record `view_render_receipt` with locale, accessibility mode, presentation schema version and field-presence bitset. UI click/chat reply/provider OAuth remains an input event only; `HumanGateDecision` is produced only after canonical mapping and authority/authn validation.\\n\\n## 14.R｜Retained r1 details under r2 closure\\n\\n`HUMAN_GATE_POLICY_SPEC` materializes deterministic rule IDs rather than placeholder prose:\\n\\n```yaml\\nHumanGatePolicy:\\n  action_class: operation_class\\n  effect_risk_tier: LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH | CRITICAL | RUIN | UNKNOWN_RUIN\\n  subject_risk_class: risk_class_ref\\n  permission_class: P0 | P1 | P2 | P3 | P4 | P5\\n  requirement_rule_id: HG-RULE-*\\n  required_human_authority: authority_requirement\\n  required_coapprovals: [authority_requirement]\\n  required_authn_assurance: AAC1 | AAC2 | AAC3\\n  max_reauth_age: duration_policy\\n  decision_scope: scope_contract\\n  purpose_binding: purpose_ref\\n  evidence_shown_to_approver: evidence_projection_contract\\n  approval_requirement_schema: ApprovalRequirementSchemaRef\\n  human_gate_decision_schema: HumanGateDecisionSchemaRef\\n  approval_token_schema: ApprovalTokenSchemaRef\\n  expiry: expiry_policy\\n  trusted_clock_profile: TrustedClockProfileRef\\n  revoke: revocation_policy\\n  deny: denial_policy\\n  appeal: appeal_policy\\n  emergency_stop: safe_stop_policy\\n  reapproval_trigger: reapproval_policy_ref\\n  delegated_authority_limits: delegation_contract\\n  prohibited_self_approval: true\\n  consumer_verification: verification_contract\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
